{
  "name": "Loop Work \u2014 Calendar Sheet + Drive",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Sheet calendar\nEvery run takes the next row with status = pending.\nSchedule = 1 topic / day.\n\nPaste spreadsheet ID in Config.\nConnect Google Sheets login.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "cd000",
      "name": "STEP 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -700,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cd001",
      "name": "1. Test in editor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "cd002",
      "name": "1. Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -360,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sid",
              "name": "spreadsheetId",
              "value": "PASTE_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sn",
              "name": "sheetName",
              "value": "Calendar",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "df",
              "name": "driveFolderId",
              "value": "PASTE_DRIVE_PARENT_FOLDER_ID_HERE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "rp",
              "name": "rootPath",
              "value": "C:\\Users\\littu\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\lit\\loop-work",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "out",
              "name": "outDir",
              "value": "={{ 'C:\\\\Users\\\\littu\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\lit\\\\loop-work' + '\\\\output\\\\' + $now.toFormat('yyyyMMdd-HHmmss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "gm",
              "name": "geminiModel",
              "value": "gemini-2.5-flash",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd003",
      "name": "2. Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.spreadsheetId }",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.sheetName }",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd004",
      "name": "3. Read calendar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        280,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "SHEETS",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "st",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "pending",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "cd005",
      "name": "3. Keep pending only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        540,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": 1
      },
      "id": "cd006",
      "name": "3b. One topic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Script from that topic\nGemini writes script AND divides scenes into:\nAI image / AI video / stock\nThen the Sheet is updated.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "cd007",
      "name": "STEP 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sys",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "value": "You are the content director for LOOP WORK (n8n automation, website design, digital marketing). Faceless 9:16 Instagram Reel / YouTube Short.\n\nLOOK: magic hour, golden rim light, teal shadows, photoreal, no text, no logos, no UI.\n\nFrom the given calendar TOPIC only, write the script, then DIVIDE the script into exactly 6 scenes. Each scene has ONE visual type:\n\nVISUAL MIX (exact):\n- 2 scenes visual_type = \"ai_image\"\n- 2 scenes visual_type = \"stock_video\"\n- 1 scene visual_type = \"stock_photo\"\n- 1 scene visual_type = \"ai_video\"\n\nai_prompt starts with: \"cinematic still, magic hour, golden rim light, teal shadows,\"\nai_video_prompt = same look + one camera move, 4 seconds, no text, no dialogue\nstock_query = 3-6 real Pexels words, golden hour / laptop / small business. No brand names.\nimage_to_video_prompt = \"slow cinematic push in, dust in sunbeams, no morphing, no text\"\n\nHook in sentence 1. 125-155 words. Scene narrations concatenated = script.\n\nReturn JSON only:\n{\"title\":\"\",\"hook\":\"\",\"script\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"hashtags\":[\"loopwork\"],\"youtube_description\":\"\",\"visual_plan\":\"2 ai_image + 2 stock_video + 1 stock_photo + 1 ai_video\",\"scenes\":[{\"id\":1,\"narration\":\"\",\"visual_type\":\"ai_image\",\"stock_query\":\"\",\"ai_prompt\":\"\",\"ai_video_prompt\":\"\",\"image_to_video_prompt\":\"\"}]}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "usr",
              "name": "userPrompt",
              "value": "={ 'Channel: Loop Work. Platform: ' + $('3b. One topic').first().json.platform + '\\nCalendar date: ' + $('3b. One topic').first().json.date + '\\nTOPIC: ' + $('3b. One topic').first().json.topic + '\\nDivide visuals from this topic only. Return JSON only.' }",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd008",
      "name": "4. Script prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1060,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={ 'https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/' + $('2. Config').first().json.geminiModel + ':generateContent?key=' + $env.GEMINI_API_KEY }",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ systemInstruction: { parts: [{ text: $json.systemPrompt }] }, contents: [{ role: 'user', parts: [{ text: $json.userPrompt }] }], generationConfig: { temperature: 0.75, responseMimeType: 'application/json' } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "cd009",
      "name": "4. Gemini script + visual split",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "pack",
              "name": "pack",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text.replaceAll('```json','').replaceAll('```','').trim()) }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd010",
      "name": "5. Extract pack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1620,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Update Sheet + Drive folder\nScript lands in the row.\nOne Drive folder for this day holds script, images, stock, AI video, audio, final mp4.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cd011",
      "name": "STEP 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1900,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.spreadsheetId }",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.sheetName }",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "operation": "update",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={ $('3b. One topic').first().json.date }",
            "status": "script_done",
            "script": "={ $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.script }",
            "hook": "={ $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.hook }",
            "caption": "={ $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.caption }",
            "hashtags": "={ ($('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.hashtags || []).join(' ') }",
            "visual_plan": "={ $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.visual_plan }"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "date"
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd012",
      "name": "6. Sheet: save script",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1900,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "SHEETS",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "={{ \"powershell -NoProfile -Command \\\"New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path '\" + $('2. Config').first().json.outDir + \"\\\\media','\" + $('2. Config').first().json.outDir + \"\\\\clips' | Out-Null\\\"\" }"
      },
      "id": "cd013",
      "name": "7. Local folders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "={ $('3b. One topic').first().json.date + ' - ' + ($('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.title || $('3b. One topic').first().json.topic) }",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive",
          "cachedResultName": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.driveFolderId }"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd014",
      "name": "8. Create Drive folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        2180,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "DRIVE",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "t",
              "name": "scriptText",
              "value": "={ $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.title + '\\n\\n' + $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack.script }",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd015",
      "name": "8b. Script to file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        2460,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "sourceProperty": "scriptText",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "script.txt",
          "encoding": "utf8"
        }
      },
      "id": "cd016",
      "name": "8c. Script binary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2700,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upload",
        "name": "script.txt",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive",
          "cachedResultName": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={ $('8. Create Drive folder').first().json.id }"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd017",
      "name": "8d. Upload script to Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        2940,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "DRIVE",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.spreadsheetId }",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={ $('2. Config').first().json.sheetName }",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "operation": "update",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={ $('3b. One topic').first().json.date }",
            "drive_folder": "={ 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/' + $('8. Create Drive folder').first().json.id }",
            "drive_script": "={{ $json.webViewLink || $json.webContentLink }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "date"
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd018",
      "name": "8e. Sheet: script Drive link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        3180,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "SHEETS",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Visuals from the script split\nSwitch:\n\u2022 ai_image = Pollinations\n\u2022 stock_video / stock_photo = Pexels\n\u2022 ai_video = Pollinations wan-fast (free key) or fallback stock\nEach file -> Drive + local disk for FFmpeg.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "cd019",
      "name": "STEP 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2460,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "pack",
              "name": "pack",
              "value": "={ $('5. Extract pack').first().json.pack }",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd020",
      "name": "9. Reload pack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        2460,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "pack.scenes",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd021",
      "name": "9b. Split scenes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2700,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "no",
              "name": "scene_no",
              "value": "={{ $itemIndex + 1 }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd022",
      "name": "9c. Number scenes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        2940,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cd023",
      "name": "10. Loop scenes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        3180,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "v1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.visual_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "ai_image",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "ai_image"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "v2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.visual_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "stock_video",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "stock_video"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "v3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.visual_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "stock_photo",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "stock_photo"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "v4",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.visual_type }}",
                    "rightValue": "ai_video",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "ai_video"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "id": "cd024",
      "name": "11. Switch visual type",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        3460,
        720
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={ 'https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/' + encodeURIComponent(($('10. Loop scenes').item.json.ai_prompt || 'cinematic still, magic hour, golden rim light, teal shadows, photoreal workspace') ) + '?width=1080&height=1920&model=flux&nologo=true' }",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "cd025",
      "name": "12. AI image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        3800,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={ 'https://api.pexels.com/v1/videos/search?query=' + encodeURIComponent($('10. Loop scenes').item.json.stock_query || 'golden hour laptop') + '&orientation=portrait&per_page=5' }",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ $env.PEXELS_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "cd026",
      "name": "13. Pexels video search",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        3800,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "u",
